# k8mm-seg1opdev-multicluster v2.7 direct upstream image contract.
# Reconciled 2026-09-10 from the deployment package.
#
# Bitnami images are intentionally kept in active-bitnami-seg1opdev-v2.7.list
# so they remain active exceptions to the repository-wide Bitnami archive policy.
# Rancher transitive/system images remain covered by rancher-images-v2-15.txt.
# Private images that have no Internet-download source are tracked under
# contracts/seg1opdev-v2.7-local-images.list.

